  * The UI themes (themes/*.theme.json) are derived from the Islands themes of the IntelliJ Platform,
    https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community, directory platform/platform-resources/src/themes/islands:
      - from "Islands Light" (ManyIslandsLight.theme.json): MorningMist, BlueMist, PeriwinkleIslands,
        LavenderMistBlue, LavenderMistGold, LavenderMistIndigo
      - from "Islands Dark" (ManyIslandsDark.theme.json): Graphite, PeriwinkleNight, Abyss
    Changes: colour tokens, selected UI keys and the icon palette were replaced with values derived from
    Visual Studio or designed for the theme; name, author and editor scheme were changed.

  * The editor colour schemes (colorSchemes/*.xml) are derived from the colour schemes of the
    Rider UI Theme Pack, https://github.com/JetBrains/rider-theme-pack:
      - from "Visual Studio Light" (VisualStudioLight.xml): MorningMist, LavenderMist,
        LavenderMistPurple, BlueMist, PeriwinkleIslands
      - from "Visual Studio Dark" (VisualStudioDark.xml): Graphite, PeriwinkleNight, Abyss
    Changes: selected colours and text attributes were replaced or added, including mappings for
    Java, Kotlin, Go and Python; the schemes were renamed.

The derived files are produced at build time from the JetBrains files shipped inside an installed Rider.
The JetBrains originals are not part of this repository.

The Morning Mist and Graphite colour values were read from the theme data of an installed copy of
Microsoft Visual Studio 2026 (its Cool Breeze and Dark themes) and from screenshots of it. Blue Mist, Lavender Mist and Periwinkle Islands
are designed themes inspired by the Blue theme of Visual Studio 2019/2022; Periwinkle Night and Abyss are
designed themes of their own.
No Microsoft artwork, icons, fonts or other assets are included.

